WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:06.477
Logs → Webchat lists one row per chat, latest message first

00:00:06.477 --> 00:00:09.676
Click a chat to open it

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:14.738
The chat ID, total cost and turns cover every session

00:00:14.738 --> 00:00:19.795
Transcript: every session, each with its own tool calls

00:00:19.795 --> 00:00:23.623
Copy one session's call ID from its divider
